      "writtenOn": "2023-05-16T00:21:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e This used to handle the case when it wasn\u0027t connected.\n\nNo it doesn\u0027t attempt to connect. When `GATT_GetConnIdIfConnected` returned false, `conn_id` wouldn\u0027t even be updated and would be the default value (zero) in C++, while `GATT_INVALID_CONN_ID` is actually `0xFFFF`.",
      "parentUuid": "2541d40e_0f3d7ed4",
