      "writtenOn": "2023-05-16T00:36:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. If GATT is not connected then we go to `dis_gatt_c_read_dis_req` and read something from conn_id\u003d0. Not pretty sure whether there is anything harmful, but I see some warnings and GATT_Disconnect is called with conn_id\u003d0.",
